id: pm-beads-8h18
title: Certify pm-beads on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "Upgrade the package-local pm CLI SDK and shared PM release dependencies to current published versions. Verify package and tracker gates with the installed binary, npm and Bun entrypoints, and preserve the published data and release contracts."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-26T23:48:03.601Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T10:25:36.719Z"
assignee: pi-cert-a
claim_principal: pi-cert-a
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "The package-local pm CLI is 2026.9.26; release:check and strict PM health pass; npm and Bun entrypoints work against real tracker data; CHANGELOG and release notes remain generated by pm-changelog; the PR links this item and its exact-head review evidence."
actual_result: "2026.10.4 round: pins @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.4, pm-ops 2026.10.4, pm-changelog 2026.9.25 (all exact, latest npm), @types/node lockfile 26.6.4, codeql-action SHAs 2892aa5e. release:check green 352/352, coverage 100/100/100 measured dimensions, npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev clean, strict pm health ok. Launcher re-copied byte-identical from pm-ops 2026.10.4 template with a new fail-closed regression test. Dogfood through npx and bunx on a real tracker copy (import/export/validate/diff, 91/91 round-trip drift-free). pm-github 2026.10.4 managed extension installed with a clean read-only sync dry-run. No open Dependabot security alerts in this repo."
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T05:54:11.433Z",claude-hub,"2026-09-28: pinned pm-ops 2026.9.28 and re-copied its templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts (pm-ops#124: the omit-dev skip now checks every Node resolution path for an incomplete hoisted pm-ops, so a broken ancestor install fails instead of silently skipping the merge drivers). release:check and changelog:check pass on this branch."
  "2026-10-02T18:23:26.486Z",pi-land-a,"Merge-readiness verification pass by pi-land-a (fleet PR landing session): exact head 5c61a0e is up to date with origin/main (merge-base equals main tip), mergeable and CLEAN; Node 22/26, CodeQL, Greptile, Semgrep, DeepScan and Hound CI are green; both review threads are resolved (the ancestor-path finding was withdrawn by Greptile); Greptile's exact-head summary rates this PR 5/5 'safe to merge' (pm-beads#124 issuecomment-5864334208) and CodeRabbit's full review of this head finished with no new actionable findings (issuecomment-5864302041). Sourcery budget exhausted (quota notice, not a review); Gemini not active."
  "2026-10-02T21:45:06.008Z",codex-sol,"Restart by codex-sol: retained pushed head d29e031 inspected, no local/unpushed work. Rebase origin/main up to date. Preserve prior CodeRabbit literal-version refusal: exact package pin, installed SDK identity and peer-floor checks already enforce the repository contract without duplicating the literal. Revalidating full CI release gate and current review state."
  "2026-10-02T22:09:15.826Z",codex-sol,"Restart verification complete on retained source head d29e031: npm ci and direct npm run release:check passed 351/351 tests with zero failures/skips; 100% V8 lines/branches/functions across 7 sources; 62 documented declarations; zero production vulnerabilities; pack, changelog, date and attestation checks pass. Linked node --test test/packaging.test.ts passed 5/5. Strict health passed with existing stale/provenance advisories. JSONL history prefix is preserved. Independent statement measurement remains unproven. Following commit contains only this PM evidence; final-head CI and review are separate receipts."
  "2026-10-04T10:13:08.619Z",pi-cert-a,"Reusing this open certification chore for the 2026.10.4 round: pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.4 (supersedes Dependabot #129's 2026.10.1), pm-ops 2026.10.4 (supersedes #127's 2026.9.29), @types/node lockfile 26.6.4 (newer than #126's 26.6.3), codeql-action SHAs 2892aa5e (#125). pm-changelog stays 2026.9.25 (latest npm). No open Dependabot security alerts. Launcher to be re-copied from the installed pm-ops 2026.10.4 template."
  "2026-10-04T10:25:35.920Z",pi-cert-a,"2026.10.4 round evidence: full gate green — npm run release:check passes 352/352 tests (added the unreadable-lookup-path fail-closed regression for the new pm-ops 2026.10.4 launcher template), coverage 100% lines/branches/functions across sources, audit:prod 0 vulnerabilities, pack/changelog/attestation/date checks ok; ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit exits 0; npm audit --omit=dev AND npm audit both report 0 vulnerabilities (no jscpd4 alias in this repo). scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts re-copied byte-identical from pm-ops@2026.10.4 templates (its probe now fails closed on EACCES/ELOOP/ENOTDIR lookup paths — pm-ops #136).\n\nDogfood (pm-beads-2026.10.4.tgz installed into a scratch copy of this repo's real tracker):\n- npm: `npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 beads export -o full.beads.jsonl` -> exported 91; `beads diff full.beads.jsonl --against-workspace` -> 91/91 unchanged, drift: false; `beads validate` -> OK; `beads import --validate-only` -> OK (2 records).\n- bun: `bunx --bun @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 beads import fixture.beads.jsonl` -> created 2, timestamped 2; re-import --upsert -> updated 2 (idempotent); export+diff clean.\nScratch copy deleted afterwards.\n\npm-github: installed as managed extension pm-github@2026.10.4 (npm:pm-github); read-only preview `pm github sync --repo unbraind/pm-beads --dry-run` -> 'No pm items linked to unbraind/pm-beads' planned 0, synced 0. No issues created/modified, no scheduled sync."
notes[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-26T23:53:55.032Z",codex,"PM CLI/SDK 2026.9.26, pm-ops 2026.9.26, pm-changelog 2026.9.25 are installed and exact-pinned. Full local release:check passed 350/350 tests, zero skips, 100% measured lines/branches/functions, zero production audit vulnerabilities, changelog, provenance and date gates. Disposable packed-package installation via npx CLI 2026.9.26 activated pm-beads; Bun CLI imported two real open pm-cli GitHub issues, npx exported them, strict Beads diff found no drift, repeat Bun upsert created zero and updated two, complete tracker read returned two unique items, and strict health had no warnings. Package tracker strict health is ok=true with two existing stale-item advisories and one provenance value advisory. The preexisting package gate initially failed on the new canonical pm-ops launcher and stale literal host-version test; both were corrected and full gate rerun passed."
  "2026-09-26T23:55:23.677Z",codex,"PM-linked npm run release:check executed in the CLI isolated test environment: 1/1 passed, exit 0, 66.4 seconds; 350/350 package tests and the full gate passed again. The configured coverage gate measures lines, branches, and functions at 100%; statement coverage is not separately reported, so a four-metric 100/100/100/100 claim is not established. Strict tracker health remains ok=true with stale-item and provenance advisories; those are not upgrade regressions demonstrated by this change."
  "2026-09-27T00:03:43.811Z",codex,PR #124 CodeRabbit inline finding requested a regression for an existing but unresolvable pm-ops package. Added a dangling package symlink fixture; the canonical launcher now has a direct fail-closed test that would fail if the lstatSync guard were removed. Focused lifecycle suite passed 7/7. Full release gate and exact-head review are being repeated after this edit.
  "2026-09-27T00:05:04.391Z",codex,"After CodeRabbit finding #4113448109, the full local release gate passed again: 351/351 tests, zero skips, 100% measured lines/branches/functions, zero production vulnerabilities, and all changelog/provenance/date/package gates green. The regression exercises a dangling pm-ops symlink and requires nonzero exit without the omit-dev skip notice. Statement coverage remains unmeasured."
